        dcterms:description "Vendors and SHA-256-verifies the CC BY 4.0 4-stage transverse confocal micrograph of Drosophila melanogaster ventral furrow formation (`datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg`), automatically segments all 4 stages (`DV/ML = 1.0496 -> 1.0291 -> 0.9620 -> 0.9217`, `dv_compression_px = 42.0`, `mesoderm_internalization_frac = 0.1458`), quantifies ventral apical Myosin-II red channel enrichment (`1.632x`), and validates the 4-stage invagination trajectory (`r = 0.9993, p = 6.95e-4`)." ;
